WEBVTT

00:00:01.131 --> 00:00:03.867
Hey, do you think
Mr. Bear knows

00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:06.136
about us and how we
control the different seasons?

00:00:06.136 --> 00:00:07.337
Hey, Saga.

00:00:07.337 --> 00:00:09.931
Oh, don't ask me that.

00:00:10.173 --> 00:00:14.011
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:14.011 --> 00:00:16.847
Kuchibiru ni

00:00:16.847 --> 00:00:21.113
Namida no rouge

00:00:41.405 --> 00:00:45.142
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:45.142 --> 00:00:52.378
Ai nante, Shiritaku naiwa

00:00:55.919 --> 00:00:59.323
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:59.323 --> 00:01:02.492
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:02.492 --> 00:01:05.950
Namida no rouge

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:14.137
Mokuyo ni

00:01:14.137 --> 00:01:16.973
Bara o kai

00:01:16.973 --> 00:01:21.103
Tegami o soete

00:01:24.748 --> 00:01:28.118
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:28.118 --> 00:01:31.121
Yume de au

00:01:31.121 --> 00:01:36.115
Anata wa yasashii

00:01:46.169 --> 00:01:47.137
Are you all right?

00:01:47.137 --> 00:01:49.128
Are you ok, Vincent?

00:01:56.947 --> 00:01:58.005
S-Sorry.

00:01:58.348 --> 00:02:01.943
The doctor says it will be about
ten days until he's fully healed.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.985
What a pain.

00:02:05.288 --> 00:02:11.161
Without Vincent's piano,
the play can't go on.

00:02:11.161 --> 00:02:15.291
And tomorrow's our last
performance in this town, too.

00:02:15.766 --> 00:02:17.757
Are we going to cancel it?

00:02:18.402 --> 00:02:18.969
No!

00:02:18.969 --> 00:02:21.638
Let's find someone else
who can play the piano.

00:02:21.638 --> 00:02:23.333
I'm sure we'll find someone!

00:02:23.673 --> 00:02:26.073
Oh, I think I know
who we could use.

00:02:31.348 --> 00:02:34.017
What? Me play piano?

00:02:34.017 --> 00:02:35.109
Yes.

00:02:35.285 --> 00:02:39.119
Vincent said he wanted
you to take his place.

00:02:39.423 --> 00:02:40.157
Saga!

00:02:40.157 --> 00:02:41.825
Are you gonna
play the piano?

00:02:41.825 --> 00:02:42.519
Waffo!

00:02:42.793 --> 00:02:45.195
I get to hear Saga's
piano playing again!

00:02:45.195 --> 00:02:46.596
We can't cancel
the performance

00:02:46.596 --> 00:02:49.132
just because
Vincent was injured.

00:02:49.132 --> 00:02:51.668
Thankfully, tomorrow
is our last performance.

00:02:51.668 --> 00:02:54.404
So, we wanted to ask
you to do it just this once.

00:02:54.404 --> 00:02:56.807
Oh, here's the music.

00:02:56.807 --> 00:02:57.933
I can't!

00:02:58.275 --> 00:02:59.409
I'm sorry,

00:02:59.409 --> 00:03:00.637
but I can't.

00:03:01.011 --> 00:03:03.146
What? Why not?

00:03:03.146 --> 00:03:05.410
Oh, yeah,

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:08.242
I understand.

00:03:08.452 --> 00:03:11.148
I'd probably say the
same thing in your position.

00:03:11.388 --> 00:03:12.377
Exactly.

00:03:13.356 --> 00:03:14.220
Yeah,

00:03:14.624 --> 00:03:18.361
but I promised to
give this to you.

00:03:18.361 --> 00:03:19.529
Sorry!!

00:03:19.529 --> 00:03:21.087
Oh, huh?
But I can't!

00:03:21.665 --> 00:03:22.654
Saga.

00:03:22.999 --> 00:03:24.091
Is something wrong?

00:03:24.501 --> 00:03:28.096
Hey, are you going to
play the piano or not?
What's with him, anyway?

00:03:33.677 --> 00:03:35.212
Just because he's injured,

00:03:35.212 --> 00:03:39.546
why do I have to be the
one to take his place?

00:03:53.129 --> 00:03:54.118
Saga?

00:03:55.665 --> 00:03:57.133
Are you still awake?

00:03:57.133 --> 00:04:00.125
Y-Yeah.
But I'll go to sleep soon.

00:04:00.504 --> 00:04:03.640
Are you still thinking
about that offer to play?

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.540
That's not it.

00:04:05.675 --> 00:04:08.111
I had no intention
of accepting, anyway.

00:04:08.111 --> 00:04:09.212
I see.

00:04:09.212 --> 00:04:11.982
It's best to do
as you wish, then...

00:04:11.982 --> 00:04:14.382
to do whatever
makes you happy.

00:04:15.151 --> 00:04:17.587
It's late now,
so go to sleep soon.

00:04:17.587 --> 00:04:18.889
Yes, Grandma.

00:04:18.889 --> 00:04:19.878
Good night.

00:04:20.257 --> 00:04:21.246
Good night.

00:04:24.261 --> 00:04:27.958
Saga, it's Mr. Bear.

00:04:32.269 --> 00:04:33.136
Tomorrow

00:04:33.136 --> 00:04:35.104
I've got to go and
turn down that offer.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:45.345
What is it, Saga?

00:04:45.448 --> 00:04:46.516
Hey, Saga!

00:04:46.516 --> 00:04:47.751
Oh. What?

00:04:47.751 --> 00:04:49.686
Do you want to
come with me again?

00:04:49.686 --> 00:04:50.954
To The Bear Pianist?

00:04:50.954 --> 00:04:52.756
I'll go with you.

00:04:52.756 --> 00:04:55.892
Are you sure, Norma?
Cheryl is a... you know.

00:04:55.892 --> 00:04:59.589
Even though she's a girl,
she's still cool.

00:05:00.096 --> 00:05:01.364
So I'm going.

00:05:01.364 --> 00:05:03.967
Besides, this is the
last performance.

00:05:03.967 --> 00:05:05.468
How about you, Saga?

00:05:05.468 --> 00:05:06.670
Sorry.

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:08.638
I have plans today.

00:05:09.673 --> 00:05:11.072
Why?

00:05:12.475 --> 00:05:14.945
Saga, aren't you
going to play piano?

00:05:14.945 --> 00:05:16.980
I was looking forward to it.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:18.782
Why not?
Why aren't you gonna play?

00:05:18.782 --> 00:05:19.840
Just because!

00:05:25.055 --> 00:05:26.156
Come to think of it,

00:05:26.156 --> 00:05:28.249
that's what it's called,
a theater troupe.

00:05:28.525 --> 00:05:30.961
Today is supposed to
be their last performance.

00:05:30.961 --> 00:05:32.429
Have you already been, Saga?

00:05:32.429 --> 00:05:34.522
Huh?
Oh, yeah.

00:05:34.864 --> 00:05:36.499
Oh!
Was it interesting?

00:05:36.499 --> 00:05:37.591
Yeah, I guess.

00:05:37.834 --> 00:05:39.836
It seems to have
gotten good reviews.

00:05:39.836 --> 00:05:43.907
I see. Well, if you say so.
Maybe I'll go see for myself.

00:05:43.907 --> 00:05:44.896
Hey, Saga!

00:05:45.275 --> 00:05:48.767
-Play the piano!
-Play the piano!

00:05:49.579 --> 00:05:51.114
What is it, Saga?

00:05:51.114 --> 00:05:52.103
N-Nothing.

00:05:55.719 --> 00:05:57.020
It'll be lonely.

00:05:57.020 --> 00:06:00.114
They were good customers,
that theater troupe.

00:06:00.924 --> 00:06:05.495
Saga will want to play
the piano more and more.

00:06:05.495 --> 00:06:06.723
Y-You're right.
Saga will want to play
the piano more and more.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:08.131
See you later.

00:06:08.131 --> 00:06:09.928
Be careful on
your way home.

00:06:10.834 --> 00:06:11.823
Wait!

00:06:15.205 --> 00:06:15.967
Ok!

00:06:16.239 --> 00:06:18.537
I'll turn them down,
just like I planned!

00:06:19.275 --> 00:06:20.744
Hey, Saga.

00:06:20.744 --> 00:06:23.279
Why won't you play for us?

00:06:23.279 --> 00:06:26.916
I just want to hear
your piano playing!

00:06:26.916 --> 00:06:29.085
But we don't
want to force her.

00:06:29.085 --> 00:06:31.076
Is she just being stubborn?

00:06:31.321 --> 00:06:35.087
That's not it. I can play
for you guys any time.

00:06:35.592 --> 00:06:39.095
I'm just declining the
offer to take his place.

00:06:39.095 --> 00:06:40.460
Waffo!

00:06:41.097 --> 00:06:43.633
Then I want to hear
you now. Right now!

00:06:43.633 --> 00:06:45.100
Play for us!

00:06:48.071 --> 00:06:50.665
No! I'm not stopping
here today!

00:06:51.007 --> 00:06:53.601
I have to hurry
and decline his offer.

00:06:53.943 --> 00:06:55.205
Saga.

00:06:55.445 --> 00:06:57.811
Please play for us.

00:07:01.518 --> 00:07:03.486
Hey, are you going to play?

00:07:03.486 --> 00:07:04.988
Oh, I'm in a hurry.

00:07:04.988 --> 00:07:06.122
Everyone.

00:07:06.122 --> 00:07:09.125
Tonight is the last performance,

00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:10.894
of The Hammond Theater
Troupe's special tour.

00:07:10.894 --> 00:07:13.063
A fairy tale of
love and emotion.

00:07:13.063 --> 00:07:14.831
"The Bear Pianist!"

00:07:14.831 --> 00:07:16.766
Tonight is our final performance.

00:07:16.766 --> 00:07:18.101
Don't miss it!

00:07:18.101 --> 00:07:21.366
It looks like the final performance
will have a few changes.

00:07:21.638 --> 00:07:23.673
Some of the troupe
members were just here,

00:07:23.673 --> 00:07:26.141
and said they
need another piano.

00:07:26.476 --> 00:07:28.137
Is that so?

00:07:28.645 --> 00:07:32.882
Today is my last chance to
hear Vincent's piano playing.

00:07:32.882 --> 00:07:36.286
I like his performance now

00:07:36.286 --> 00:07:38.914
better than when
he was a pianist!

00:07:39.556 --> 00:07:41.024
Today's the last day.

00:07:41.024 --> 00:07:42.826
Maybe I'll go see it again.

00:07:42.826 --> 00:07:43.827
Pianist?

00:07:43.827 --> 00:07:46.129
The same as Saga's mom?

00:07:46.129 --> 00:07:48.098
Oh, didn't you know?

00:07:48.098 --> 00:07:52.034
Until a few years ago he
was a pianist in an orchestra.

00:07:52.235 --> 00:07:54.170
When the piano string broke,

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.005
he fixed it all
by himself, too.

00:07:56.005 --> 00:07:58.166
He really is something.

00:07:58.541 --> 00:08:00.168
I hadn't realized.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.169
Saga.

00:08:06.616 --> 00:08:08.174
Wait, Saga!

00:08:18.128 --> 00:08:19.117
Vincent.

00:08:19.796 --> 00:08:23.027
Hey, you came.
Thank you.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:24.534
Saga,

00:08:24.534 --> 00:08:26.336
there's a piano here, too!

00:08:26.336 --> 00:08:28.133
Are you gonna play for us here?

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:31.908
Oh, this?

00:08:31.908 --> 00:08:34.677
It looks worse than it is.

00:08:34.677 --> 00:08:36.012
It's just a sprain.

00:08:36.012 --> 00:08:37.001
Um.

00:08:38.148 --> 00:08:41.015
You were... a pianist?

00:08:41.918 --> 00:08:42.907
Yeah.

00:08:43.319 --> 00:08:46.015
Well, that was
a long time ago.

00:08:46.156 --> 00:08:47.418
Then why...

00:08:48.224 --> 00:08:51.127
Why did you play
the piano so roughly?

00:08:51.127 --> 00:08:54.464
Um... did I do that?

00:08:54.464 --> 00:08:55.732
You did!

00:08:55.732 --> 00:08:58.064
When Greta was on the stage!

00:08:58.368 --> 00:09:00.427
Oh. Oh, that time!

00:09:00.637 --> 00:09:02.867
I hope everyone liked it!

00:09:04.073 --> 00:09:08.169
But the piano almost broke!

00:09:08.511 --> 00:09:11.241
Yeah, it did break a little,

00:09:11.781 --> 00:09:13.840
but as long as
everyone enjoyed it.

00:09:15.685 --> 00:09:16.652
Hey.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:20.612
Where's the
pianist replacement?

00:09:22.225 --> 00:09:23.159
Huh?

00:09:23.159 --> 00:09:25.495
The girl from
the coffee shop?

00:09:25.495 --> 00:09:28.123
You're the one Vincent
recommended as his replacement?

00:09:28.298 --> 00:09:29.165
-Yes.

00:09:29.165 --> 00:09:30.063
-Yes.
-N-No.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.824
I can't do it.

00:09:32.235 --> 00:09:35.671
I can't play like you.

00:09:36.239 --> 00:09:40.005
I want you to play.
In my place.

00:09:40.443 --> 00:09:45.148
Wait, wait! It's not fair of you to ask
a child to take your place, Vincent.

00:09:45.148 --> 00:09:48.140
Besides, we don't even know
if she's capable or not.

00:09:48.651 --> 00:09:49.853
What? What?

00:09:49.853 --> 00:09:51.754
You've never even heard her!

00:09:51.754 --> 00:09:54.157
Saga's piano playing is great!!

00:09:54.157 --> 00:09:56.455
This guy gets on my nerves!

00:09:59.195 --> 00:10:02.221
She doesn't want
to do it, anyway.

00:10:02.432 --> 00:10:03.421
Ow!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:05.735
Hey, the lights are hot!

00:10:05.735 --> 00:10:06.793
-Yes!
-Sorry!

00:10:07.337 --> 00:10:11.706
Sorry to have asked something
impossible of you, Miss.

00:10:11.774 --> 00:10:13.743
To be told so suddenly

00:10:13.743 --> 00:10:16.337
to play such a difficult song...

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:20.817
I can play this song!

00:10:20.817 --> 00:10:23.183
Huh? You can play this?

00:10:24.087 --> 00:10:27.123
Uh. Yeah, well. But, um...

00:10:27.123 --> 00:10:30.058
See, I told you
she'd be all right.

00:10:30.159 --> 00:10:31.127
Hmm...

00:10:31.127 --> 00:10:35.131
If Vincent recommends you,
then I guess it's all right.

00:10:35.131 --> 00:10:36.065
B-But.

00:10:36.065 --> 00:10:37.133
What are you doing?

00:10:37.133 --> 00:10:38.968
It's almost show time.

00:10:38.968 --> 00:10:41.571
Oh, is it that time already?

00:10:41.571 --> 00:10:45.132
Ok, we're counting
on you then!

00:10:45.441 --> 00:10:46.430
Um...

00:10:46.542 --> 00:10:49.443
Hey, we've decided on
the piano replacement.

00:10:49.846 --> 00:10:50.813
We're counting on you!
I just can't do it.

00:10:50.813 --> 00:10:52.110
I just can't do it.

00:10:52.282 --> 00:10:55.551
Oh, this girl is the
pianist replacement?

00:10:55.551 --> 00:10:56.848
Nice to meet you.

00:10:57.053 --> 00:10:58.042
No, um...

00:10:59.389 --> 00:11:00.423
So that means...

00:11:00.423 --> 00:11:03.153
It means we'll get to
hear Saga's piano playing!

00:11:03.326 --> 00:11:04.160
Waffo!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:05.491
Yay!

00:11:06.396 --> 00:11:07.664
H-Hey.

00:11:07.664 --> 00:11:08.653
Saga.

00:11:09.499 --> 00:11:10.488
Thank you.

00:11:12.669 --> 00:11:14.660
S-Stupid me!

00:11:25.682 --> 00:11:27.673
Ok, it's time.

00:11:37.026 --> 00:11:40.120
-Huh?
-What? Saga!
-Hey. Quit it!

00:11:40.496 --> 00:11:42.832
Don't interfere, please!

00:11:42.832 --> 00:11:44.133
It's almost show time.

00:11:44.133 --> 00:11:44.867
Ok!
It's almost show time.

00:11:44.867 --> 00:11:45.702
Ok!

00:11:45.702 --> 00:11:47.693
Wow, it's almost time!

00:11:52.542 --> 00:11:55.670
Waffo! They all want to
hear Saga's piano playing!

00:11:56.112 --> 00:11:57.647
Yeah!! There they are.

00:11:57.647 --> 00:12:00.083
Everyone's here, Saga!

00:12:00.083 --> 00:12:01.851
There really are a
lot of people here.

00:12:01.851 --> 00:12:05.912
Oh. Elder, Ginger and
Turmeric are here, too.

00:12:09.692 --> 00:12:13.196
Huh? Could it be that
you're nervous, Saga?

00:12:13.196 --> 00:12:14.897
Oh, of course I am!

00:12:14.897 --> 00:12:18.094
This is the first time I've played
in front of such a large crowd.

00:12:21.004 --> 00:12:24.098
Why did I say I
would play, anyway?

00:12:25.174 --> 00:12:27.108
Hurry up and play, Saga.

00:12:28.444 --> 00:12:30.708
Saga?
What's the matter?

00:12:30.947 --> 00:12:31.948
Saga?

00:12:31.948 --> 00:12:32.937
What's the matter?

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.443
You look a little tense.

00:12:36.819 --> 00:12:38.411
Just be the same old
Saga you always are.

00:12:38.888 --> 00:12:42.325
Even if you make a mistake,
we're here, so it'll be okay.

00:12:42.325 --> 00:12:44.122
Y-Yes,
you're right!

00:12:44.394 --> 00:12:46.129
Thank you for coming.

00:12:46.129 --> 00:12:49.699
To the final performance of The
Hammond Theater Troupe tonight.

00:12:49.699 --> 00:12:53.536
They will now perform
"The Bear Pianist."

00:12:53.536 --> 00:12:54.871
They will now perform
"The Bear Pianist."
It's almost time,

00:12:54.871 --> 00:12:56.532
so let's enjoy it, Saga!

00:12:58.808 --> 00:13:00.070
See you afterwards.

00:13:00.676 --> 00:13:01.911
We're counting
on you, Vincent!!

00:13:01.911 --> 00:13:02.605
Yeah!

00:13:03.046 --> 00:13:04.047
We're counting on you!

00:13:04.047 --> 00:13:05.207
Oh, ok!

00:13:26.869 --> 00:13:28.097
Come on, hurry!

00:13:29.272 --> 00:13:32.708
Hey, Grandma,
what's that piano sound?

00:13:32.708 --> 00:13:36.379
That's the Bear Pianist playing.

00:13:36.379 --> 00:13:38.147
Bear Pianist?

00:13:38.147 --> 00:13:41.116
Yes.
Playing for the one he loves.

00:13:42.318 --> 00:13:43.686
Once upon a time,

00:13:43.686 --> 00:13:49.124
in the middle of the woods, there
was a bear that could play the piano.

00:13:50.393 --> 00:13:53.329
No one wants me for a companion.
Oh, how wonderful it would be.

00:13:53.329 --> 00:13:54.564
Hey, Saga.
No one wants me for a companion.
Oh, how wonderful it would be.

00:13:54.564 --> 00:13:56.132
Save it for later!
If only I could become human.

00:13:56.132 --> 00:13:58.201
If you want to be
human that badly,

00:13:58.201 --> 00:13:59.435
I'll grant your wish.

00:13:59.435 --> 00:14:01.137
Who's there?
Where are you?

00:14:01.137 --> 00:14:02.538
Who are you?

00:14:02.538 --> 00:14:06.133
I grant beautiful wishes.

00:14:08.778 --> 00:14:09.879
Thirteen, fourteen...

00:14:09.879 --> 00:14:10.880
Saga!

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:11.714
Thanks.

00:14:11.714 --> 00:14:12.615
Fifteen?

00:14:12.615 --> 00:14:15.015
Huh?
One page is missing!

00:14:21.858 --> 00:14:22.859
Here, Saga!

00:14:22.859 --> 00:14:23.848
Thanks, Sugar.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.229
You're doing great, Saga!

00:14:26.229 --> 00:14:27.196
Keep it up!

00:14:27.196 --> 00:14:28.493
Just as I thought:

00:14:30.333 --> 00:14:32.733
The songs you play
are very gentle sounding.

00:14:32.835 --> 00:14:33.927
Not at all.

00:14:35.938 --> 00:14:37.106
Vincent! Hurry! Hurry!

00:14:37.106 --> 00:14:39.097
Vincent! Hurry! Hurry!
Oh, talk to you later.

00:14:46.415 --> 00:14:48.110
That's not true at all.

00:14:49.051 --> 00:14:50.040
Saga?

00:14:51.387 --> 00:14:53.890
It's no use.
I can't play anymore.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.625
Why do you say that?

00:14:55.625 --> 00:14:57.960
Saga, please calm down.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:02.131
Vincent said you were
doing well, didn't he?

00:15:02.131 --> 00:15:04.867
Yeah!
I don't think it's bad, either!

00:15:04.867 --> 00:15:06.732
Ooh, it's no use!

00:15:06.969 --> 00:15:10.735
I don't even know
what I'm playing now!

00:15:12.141 --> 00:15:15.269
It's no use trying
to play like this.

00:15:19.081 --> 00:15:20.070
Oh!

00:15:30.426 --> 00:15:33.452
I love your
piano playing, Saga.

00:15:33.629 --> 00:15:35.221
I like Mr. Bear's playing, too.

00:15:35.464 --> 00:15:37.200
Listening to it is fun,

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.435
and makes me happy,
and makes me smile.

00:15:39.435 --> 00:15:42.268
You have fun playing the
piano, too, don't you, Saga?

00:15:42.705 --> 00:15:45.308
You love playing piano.

00:15:45.308 --> 00:15:47.677
I love your piano
playing, too, Saga!

00:15:47.677 --> 00:15:49.078
Me, too!

00:15:49.078 --> 00:15:51.280
So it's all right.
Saga!

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.111
Play the piano. Ok?

00:15:56.152 --> 00:15:57.119
Ok.

00:16:06.896 --> 00:16:11.856
If only I might dispel
your loneliness at night.

00:16:12.168 --> 00:16:14.136
What beautiful music.

00:16:19.909 --> 00:16:21.536
I don't have the music!

00:16:24.313 --> 00:16:25.371
I can't find it!

00:16:25.681 --> 00:16:27.080
Let's look again!

00:16:27.283 --> 00:16:28.079
Ok!

00:16:43.866 --> 00:16:46.096
Th-That song!

00:17:05.021 --> 00:17:07.922
If only I might dispel
your loneliness at night.

00:17:08.324 --> 00:17:10.121
It was you,
wasn't it?

00:17:57.106 --> 00:17:59.506
Thank you, Bear.

00:18:05.648 --> 00:18:06.740
Cheryl was wonderful!

00:18:10.119 --> 00:18:11.108
Saga?

00:18:34.343 --> 00:18:37.039
The Hammond Theater
Troupe is gone.

00:18:37.613 --> 00:18:38.602
Yeah.

00:18:44.587 --> 00:18:49.149
I was so moved by
your performance.

00:18:49.358 --> 00:18:51.417
Theater is wonderful,
isn't it?

00:18:51.627 --> 00:18:54.096
I'm glad to hear
you say that.

00:18:54.096 --> 00:18:57.691
I promise we'll come
here to Muhlenburg again.

00:18:58.033 --> 00:18:59.022
Yes!

00:18:59.335 --> 00:19:02.171
Cheryl, even though
you're a girl,

00:19:02.171 --> 00:19:04.807
I still think you're wonderful.

00:19:04.807 --> 00:19:07.241
Thank you.
That makes me happy.

00:19:10.179 --> 00:19:11.407
Oh, Norma!

00:19:12.381 --> 00:19:14.950
Please take this.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:19.114
It's a coffee blend I made
for all of you to drink.

00:19:19.388 --> 00:19:20.582
Thank you.

00:19:21.157 --> 00:19:25.127
It might still be
stiff-tasting, though.

00:19:25.127 --> 00:19:26.116
Stiff?

00:19:27.062 --> 00:19:30.132
Yeah, well it does get
stiff inside the train.

00:19:30.132 --> 00:19:32.123
That's not what I mean.

00:19:33.035 --> 00:19:35.333
With your coffee,

00:19:35.471 --> 00:19:37.473
I don't think that will
be a problem, Saga.

00:19:37.473 --> 00:19:38.872
Uh, um...

00:19:41.143 --> 00:19:43.134
Thank you, Saga

00:20:00.162 --> 00:20:02.960
Bye-bye, Mr. Bear!

00:20:12.775 --> 00:20:14.367
It'll be lonely,
won't it?

00:20:15.044 --> 00:20:16.102
Yeah.

00:20:18.481 --> 00:20:21.848
I sure was surprised
to see you, Saga.

00:20:22.418 --> 00:20:25.785
I had no idea that was
you playing the piano.

00:20:27.056 --> 00:20:29.258
It was a beautiful
performance.

00:20:29.258 --> 00:20:30.247
Thank you.

00:20:30.392 --> 00:20:33.054
Really!
It was a magnificent perfor...

00:20:34.129 --> 00:20:36.432
Well, I don't know
what I would think

00:20:36.432 --> 00:20:39.134
if you weren't able to
play on that level easily.

00:20:39.134 --> 00:20:43.127
As my eternal rival you
understand, don't you?

00:20:44.139 --> 00:20:47.631
Your dancing wasn't bad
that time, either, Greta.

00:20:49.144 --> 00:20:53.137
Hey, what was with
that dancing, anyway?

00:20:53.616 --> 00:20:57.245
I-It was acting,
of course. Acting!

00:20:58.454 --> 00:21:00.789
Wh-Why are you
looking at me like that?

00:21:00.789 --> 00:21:03.053
Don't you believe me?

00:21:03.492 --> 00:21:05.160
Hey, hey, Saga!

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.161
I want another Waffo!!

00:21:06.161 --> 00:21:08.664
I want another Waffo!!
You laughed at me,
didn't you, Miss Saga!

00:21:08.664 --> 00:21:10.165
Hey! Hey! Hey,
Saga, Waffo!
That's not it, Greta.

00:21:10.165 --> 00:21:14.158
Hey! Hey! Hey,
Saga, Waffo!
Fine then, Miss Saga.
I challenge you!

00:21:22.778 --> 00:21:24.109
Delicious...

00:21:30.619 --> 00:21:31.608
Hey, Sugar.

00:21:32.121 --> 00:21:35.454
Um, thanks for everything.

00:21:37.393 --> 00:21:38.655
Saga!

00:21:46.902 --> 00:21:49.138
I want to eat a waffo
tomorrow, too, Saga.

00:21:49.138 --> 00:21:50.139
Yeah, yeah.

00:21:50.139 --> 00:21:51.128
Waffo!

00:21:52.341 --> 00:21:53.609
Wow, Saga!

00:21:53.609 --> 00:21:56.134
The Magic flower!
Flower! Flower!

00:22:20.636 --> 00:22:25.040
Tsuki no negai

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:28.544
Mizu ni tokete

00:22:28.544 --> 00:22:33.849
Shiroi namiki-michi mitsuketa

00:22:33.849 --> 00:22:38.721
Hoshi-kuzu no uta

00:22:38.721 --> 00:22:47.129
Nana-iro no hashi o wataru kaze

00:22:47.129 --> 00:22:52.401
Shitte ita yo ne

00:22:52.401 --> 00:22:57.272
Kimochi tsunagu ureshisa

00:22:57.272 --> 00:22:59.274
Sugar Snow

00:22:59.274 --> 00:23:07.149
Kona-yuki mau machi ni yagate

00:23:07.149 --> 00:23:12.855
Kirei na hana saku kisetsu ni

00:23:12.855 --> 00:23:17.087
Anata o omou

00:23:19.094 --> 00:23:23.799
Kokoro o tokasu

00:23:23.799 --> 00:23:27.803
ai wa, yume wa

00:23:27.803 --> 00:23:33.571
sono mune ni aruno

00:23:39.314 --> 00:23:40.249
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:40.249 --> 00:23:41.950
Preview of Next Episode
Thank you for everything, Saga.

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:44.286
Eating waffos, fighting,
taking baths together...

00:23:44.286 --> 00:23:45.954
It was all so fun.

00:23:45.954 --> 00:23:48.524
Wh-What? Sugar, why are
you saying this so suddenly?

00:23:48.524 --> 00:23:50.259
Even though the Magic
Flower has bloomed,

00:23:50.259 --> 00:23:51.694
and I've become
a real Snow Fairy,

00:23:51.694 --> 00:23:54.630
I'll never, ever
forget you, Saga.

00:23:54.630 --> 00:23:56.398
Could it be that you
found a "Twinkle"?

00:23:56.398 --> 00:23:58.767
Huh?
Uh, um, well...

00:23:58.767 --> 00:24:02.438
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"A 'Twinkle' Found!?"

00:24:02.438 --> 00:24:03.439
Found... what?

00:24:03.439 --> 00:24:04.838
No way!
